data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Single-source reliance:** Both outcome claims rest only on source 2, and the targeting mechanism rests only on source 3. Corroboration from independent sources would strengthen them.\n- **Missing risks:** Off-target cuts and repair-efficiency limits go unmentioned. \"Insert a healthy sequence\" implies a reliability the review doesn't support.\n- **Overstated knockout claim:** Cutting a gene doesn't always stop protein production, since cells can make truncated proteins. The review should qualify this."}

